Z||000003||maryjane||08-25-2001||08:53 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by SteveJ:<BR><B>I spent that entire time in Berlin, Germany. We lost Nam and the cold war colapsed. So. . .</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>The last American ground combat troops left Viet Nam Aug 11 72. Saigon fell in '75. Don't know how you could say WE lost it,but...<BR>Guess you could say you won yours, & I lost mine. <BR><p>[This message has been edited by maryjane (edited 08-25-2001).]||||reg||1
